"], "bg": "t008", "txt": "television, and it isn't the jewelry. It's the papers. the papers that say who you are.", "d": "no es la tele, son los papeles"}, {"k": "t011", "at": 83.11, "out": 89.98, "imgs": ["t012", "t010", "t009"], "bg": "t012", "txt": "and then five things that make the best place, not a secret spot. I'm not going to give you a list of hiding", "d": "7 peores, 5 cosas del mejor lugar"}, {"k": "t023", "at": 182.06, "out": 187.96, "imgs": ["t024", "t022", "t025"], "bg": "t024", "txt": "birth certificate, together, in the wrong hands, are worth more than anything else in that room.", "d": "pasaporte + social + partida = alguien puede ser vos"}, {"k": "t028", "at": 220.44, "out": 227.93, "imgs": ["t027", "t026", "t030"], "bg": "t027", "txt": "And is it safe from the fire and the water? If a place passes one test and fails the other, it's not a good place.", "d": "las dos pruebas: ladrón y fuego/agua"}, {"k": "t029", "at": 232.53, "out": 238.18, "imgs": ["t030", "t031", "t027"], "bg": "t030", "txt": "list. The drawer of the nightstand. This is the first drawer he opens, every time.", "d": "número 7: el cajón de la mesa de luz"}, {"k": "t039", "at": 314.25, "out": 320.56, "imgs": ["t040", "t038", "t041"], "bg": "t040", "txt": "charger, a book. Number six, the sock drawer. I'm going to go quickly on this one because", "d": "número 6: el cajón de las medias"}, {"k": "t045", "at": 366.7, "out": 372.9, "imgs": ["t046", "t044", "t047"], "bg": "t046", "txt": "fails. Second test fails. Let's move on. Number five. Under the mattress.", "d": "número 5: debajo del colchón"}, {"k": "t049", "at": 398.89, "out": 406.24, "imgs": ["t050", "t047", "t051"], "bg": "t050", "txt": "list. It's the oldest hiding place in the world. People were hiding things under the mattress when my grandfather was a boy.", "d": "el escondite más viejo del mundo"}, {"k": "t056", "at": 456.78, "out": 464.14, "imgs": ["t055", "t057", "t054"], "bg": "t055", "txt": "The shoebox on the closet shelf. Now we're in the closet, and the closet is where most people think they're being smart,", "d": "número 4: la caja de zapatos arriba del placard"}, {"k": "t062", "at": 508.83, "out": 514.58, "imgs": ["t061", "t063", "t064"], "bg": "t061", "txt": "the top shelf of a closet is the hottest place in the room. Heat goes up. Smoke goes up. The", "d": "el estante de arriba es lo más caliente"}, {"k": "t065", "at": 533.31, "out": 539.43, "imgs": ["t066", "t064", "t063"], "bg": "t066", "txt": "down. This is the one that hurts me because these are the people who tried. They went to the store,", "d": "número 3: la cajita con manija"}, {"k": "t068", "at": 556.77, "out": 563.73, "imgs": ["t067", "t069", "t066"], "bg": "t067", "txt": "It's for carrying. The company put a handle on it so you could carry it, and so can he. He doesn't open the box.", "d": "la manija es para llevarla"}, {"k": "t075", "at": 618.48, "out": 625.83, "imgs": ["t076", "t074", "t073"], "bg": "t076", "txt": "answer. It's just missing the other half. Number two, the travel pouch. Now this one surprises people. A lot", "d": "número 2: la riñonera de viaje"}, {"k": "t083", "at": 690.17, "out": 695.96, "imgs": ["t082", "t084", "t085"], "bg": "t082", "txt": "pouch goes back in the drawer, empty. And number one, the worst place in the bedroom,", "d": "número 1: la carpeta que dice \"papeles importantes\""}, {"k": "t087", "at": 722.73, "out": 729.76, "imgs": ["t086", "t088", "t089"], "bg": "t086", "txt": "I don't have to say much about this one. You labeled it for him. He doesn't have to look. He doesn't have to think.", "d": "se lo rotulaste"}, {"k": "t095", "at": 787.79, "out": 793.46, "imgs": ["t094", "t096", "t093"], "bg": "t094", "txt": "Or it's easy to read. The nightstand and the sock drawer and the mattress are easy to reach.", "d": "fácil de alcanzar, de cargar, de leer"}, {"k": "t100", "at": 830.95, "out": 837.11, "imgs": ["t101", "t099", "t102"], "bg": "t101", "txt": "Joplin. In May of 2011, a tornado went through Joplin, Missouri. You may remember it.", "d": "Joplin, mayo de 2011"}, {"k": "t107", "at": 885.05, "out": 892.54, "imgs": ["t106", "t108", "t105"], "bg": "t106", "txt": "and we found the box, and it was a box of wet pulp. You could put your hand in it, and it came out like oatmeal.", "d": "caja de cartón: pulpa mojada"}, {"k": "t112", "at": 945.55, "out": 952.12, "imgs": ["t113", "t111", "t114"], "bg": "t113", "txt": "in your own house. Number one, it's bolted down. Remember the little box with the handle.", "d": "número 1: atornillada"}, {"k": "t118", "at": 995.32, "out": 1000.72, "imgs": ["t117", "t120", "t116"], "bg": "t117", "txt": "them. How long does it take? If you have a drill, about 20 minutes. You open the box,", "d": "20 minutos con un taladro"}, {"k": "t125", "at": 1051.86, "out": 1056.11, "imgs": ["t124", "t126", "t123"], "bg": "t124", "txt": "There's an answer. Number two, it's really fire resistant, and", "d": "número 2: de verdad resistente al fuego"}, {"k": "t127", "at": 1069.12, "out": 1075.42, "imgs": ["t126", "t128", "t129"], "bg": "t126", "txt": "there's a rating from an independent testing lab. The one you'll see most is a class 350 rating,", "d": "clase 350"}, {"k": "t132", "at": 1112.39, "out": 1120.76, "imgs": ["t133", "t131", "t130"], "bg": "t133", "txt": "is. For those, the rating you want is class 125, which means the inside stays under 125 degrees.", "d": "clase 125 para lo digital"}, {"k": "t136", "at": 1146.56, "out": 1153.49, "imgs": ["t137", "t135", "t134"], "bg": "t137", "txt": "walls. Look for the rating. One more thing about the label. resistant does not mean waterproof.", "d": "resistente al fuego ≠ impermeable"}, {"k": "t138", "at": 1163.19, "out": 1169.3, "imgs": ["t139", "t137", "t135"], "bg": "t139", "txt": "places. This is the one I'd tell you if I could only tell you one. Never keep all of it in one place.", "d": "número 3: nunca todo en un lugar"}, {"k": "t147", "at": 1247.48, "out": 1253.76, "imgs": ["t148", 