in it.", "d": "5 la caja: 350 / 125"}, {"k": "t197", "at": 1666.6, "out": 1673.67, "imgs": ["t196", "t198", "t195"], "bg": "t196", "txt": "the car is the worst bedroom in the world. Don't keep anything in the glove box that tells a stranger where you sleep.", "d": "el auto: el peor dormitorio del mundo"}, {"k": "t205", "at": 1746.27, "out": 1751.92, "imgs": ["t206", "t204", "t207"], "bg": "t206", "txt": "floor. Then you have two choices. Ask the landlord. You'd be surprised how many say yes", "d": "si alquilás: dos opciones"}, {"k": "t215", "at": 1827.52, "out": 1834.28, "imgs": ["t216", "t214", "t217"], "bg": "t216", "txt": "the nightstand drawer, the sock drawer, under the mattress, the shoebox on the top shelf,", "d": "repaso: los siete malos"}], "cta": [{"at": 119.88, "desc": 123.78, "end": 130.38}, {"at": 1696.2, "desc": 1700.1, "end": 1706.7}, {"at": 1869.88, "desc": 1873.78, "end": 1880.38}], "end": 1888.91, "txt": {"lower": [0.5, 3.42]}}